        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 24 at 11:48PM EDT until September 25 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 25 to 30 mph with gusts up to 50 mph.

* WHERE...Hatteras Island and Northern Outer Banks.

* WHEN...Until 8 PM EDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.

Secure outdoor objects.</instruction>
